The following species in the flowering plant genus '''''[[Thymus (plant)|Thymus]]''''', the '''thymes''', are accepted by [[Plants of the World Online]].<ref name="327150-2" >{{cite web |url=https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:327150-2 |title=''Thymus'' L. |website=Plants of the World Online |publisher=Board of Trustees of the Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew |date=2022 |accessdate=18 February 2022}}</ref> ''Thymus'' is considered a well{{nbh}}defined genus within its family as its species have consistent chemical and morphological characters.<ref>{{cite book |title=Thyme: The Genus ''Thymus'' |editor-last1=Stahl-Biskup |editor-first1=Elisabeth |editor-last2=Saez |editor-first2=Francisco |chapter=1. The history, botany and taxonomy of the genus ''Thymus'' |last1=Morales |first1=Ramón |date=5 September 2002 |page=16 |publisher=CRC Press |isbn=9780203216859 }}</ref>

